  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo po&#x13e;nohospod&#xe1;rstva, lesn&#xed;ctva a vodohospod&#xe1;rstva-&#x161;tudijn&#xe1; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Water Management-study visit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;V d&#x148;och 25.-27. septembra 2013&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;nav&#x161;t&#xed;vila SR v r&#xe1;mci programu CETIR 4-&#x10d;lenn&#xe1; deleg&#xe1;cia zo&#xa0;Srbska v nasleduj&#xfa;com zlo&#x17e;en&#xed;:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;p&#xe1;n &lt;b&gt;Perica Grbi&#x107;&lt;/b&gt; - riadite&#x13e; Oddelenia pre lesy&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;p&#xe1;n &lt;b&gt;Miodrag Strnad&lt;/b&gt; - samostatn&#xfd; poradca pre &#x161;tudijn&#xe9; a&#xa0;pl&#xe1;novan&#xe9; pr&#xe1;ce v&#xa0;oblasti po&#x13e;ovn&#xed;ctva&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;p&#xe1;n &lt;b&gt;Ljubinko Rakonjac&lt;/b&gt; - riadite&#x13e; In&#x161;tit&#xfa;tu lesn&#xed;ctva v&#xa0;Belehrade&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;pani &lt;b&gt;Vera Lavadinovi&#x107;&lt;/b&gt; - ved&#xfa;ca Oddelenia pre rozvoj os&#xed;v a&#xa0;saden&#xed;c na In&#x161;tit&#xfa;te lesn&#xed;ctva v&#xa0;Belehrade&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;4-member delegation from Serbia attended&#xa0;CETIR study visit from September 25 through September 27,&#xa0;2013:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mr Perica Grbi&#x107; - Director of the Department of Forests&lt;br /&gt;Mr. Miodrag Strand - Independent adviser for the study and future work in the field of hunting&lt;br /&gt;Mr. Ljubinko Rakonjac - Director of the Institute of Forestry in Belgrade&lt;br /&gt;Mrs Vera Lavadinovi&#x107; - Head of the Unit for the Development of seeds and seedlings Institute of Forestry in Belgrade&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
